

SUMMARY
Full Stack Developer with hands-on experience across four internships and
six shipped SaaS products. Proficient in React.js, Next.js, Node.js,
PostgreSQL, and MongoDB. Experienced integrating REST APIs and LLM APIs
(Claude, Gemini) into production applications — from building AI-powered
lead generation platforms to full-stack writing SaaS. Comfortable across the
stack, from designing RESTful backend services to shipping pixel-precise
front-end UIs. AWS and GCP Certified Cloud Practitioner.
