WritePro | Next.js, Supabase, Claude API, Stripe, Prisma
Built a full-stack AI writing SaaS using Next.js, Supabase, and Prisma with
end-to-end features including user authentication, subscription billing via
Stripe, and a real-time Claude API-powered editor
Designed and implemented a project management dashboard with role-
based access, demonstrating production-grade application architecture
beyond a single-feature prototype
Integrated Claude API to deliver context-aware writing suggestions inline,
reducing friction in the content creation workflow for end users.
LeadForge | React.js, Gemini API, REST APIs, Vercel, JavaScript
Developed an AI-powered lead generation platform using React.js and
Claude API that scrapes, enriches, and scores prospects in real time,
automating a workflow typically done manually in sales teams
Built an intelligent qualification layer using Gemini API to evaluate lead
quality against configurable criteria, reducing noise in prospect pipelines
Deployed on Vercel with REST API integrations for live data enrichment,
ensuring low-latency responses across the core user-facing flow
StyleMatch | PostgreSQL, Stripe, Python, Node.js, Express.js
Built an AI-driven ecommerce recommendation engine where users
complete a style quiz and receive personalized product matches with AI-
generated explanations, integrated end-to-end with Stripe for checkout
Designed the recommendation logic to map quiz responses to product
attributes using JavaScript and PostgreSQL, creating a data-driven
personalization layer without a third-party ML service
UrbanPulse | Next.js, MongoDB, Leaflet.js, Tailwind CSS, Firebase
